      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "Improved in 856 to a degree. This is like the other \"back bend\" issue-- if we tune the values too far one direction, we run into issues (view ball being incorrect). If we run too far the other way, we get things bending when they shouldn't.\n\nStill working on this.",
