      "statusChangeID": "5d7e97e0bd11f65c2e571e66",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "When proper weighting is completed, this is minimized. It is difficult to remove it completely when you're in certain poses, so it is still possible for this to occur. This isn't really something that can be worked around-- its an issue with attempting to \"make up\" data we don't have (chest tracking position).\n\nHowever, due to it being reduced in 856, I am going to call this Complete for now.",
